title: "frontier-ai-evals-journey: an evaluation suite for Indian-language LLMs"
abstract: >-
  A small, honest, reproducible evaluation suite for Indian-language LLMs covering native grammar,
  culturally grounded knowledge, reasoning, translation, instruction-following, and multilingual
  safety behaviour, with a published methodology, judge prompts, and a reproducibility harness.
